es":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"OcatdPIYh9X2Du3Lo5YKOQ","review_id":"fRW4Gf0jANbwx5XBuAFHpQ","date":"2017-01-14T19:05:08","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9375938177108765,"text_excerpt":"In town for NYE and we had a Groupon to dine here. Definitely a good choice!!! The service was good, we had a nice young man who was very accommodating & gave us suggestions. I had the fried seafood platter. It had catfish, shrimp, scallops, & mussels on it. It was good. Even eaten cold, which I hate, the food was delicious. They have a nice small space, but it's comfy & cozy. I'd refer them and I'd definitely go back if in town again."},{"business_id":"OcatdPIYh9X2Du3Lo5YKOQ","review_id":"8eONybbj1EoF1rvtXdOJRg","date":"2017-06-02T02:57:23","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9365923404693604,"text_excerpt":"We ate here as a family last month - my husband, myself, and our two kiddos. We lucked up on a Groupon but the waitress didn't specify until after we ordered 3 appetizers that the Groupon only went toward \"entrees\".... needless to say, we ended up with a table overflowing with food like we were hungrier than life! The fried chicken wings were beyond the best item we received. The kids had large shrimp platters with very tasty shrimp (we try out fried shrimp and wings often and Sassafras is now at the top of our chicken wing and fried shrimp list.) I saw the reviews about slow service, but our service was actually pretty quick and our waitress was very kind and personable. The restaurant i..."},{"business_id":"OcatdPIYh9X2Du3Lo5YKOQ","review_id":"mAwryL7HzEZ8-XThzcO-TQ","date":"2019-04-24T01:10:11","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9330425262451172,"text_excerpt":"Good southern, creole food! They have a counter/bar, which is where I sat for dinner. They have plenty of tables and large windows to people watch. However, the food is the main attraction, obviously! There was no real wait for the food--the order was taken quickly, and the food was filling my nostrils and tummy minutes later lol. The etouffee was really good! Literally didn't want the dish to end. It was so flavorful and the rice was perfect. The stuff bell pepper came highly recommended by the waiter. Man, she hit it on the head!! The bell pepper wasn't too hard or too soft, and each bite was just delicious!! The mac and cheese wasn't too cheese or too dry. The green was cool, but the b..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"OcatdPIYh9X2Du3Lo5YKOQ","photo_id":"pVnh5qe-Xj0czHdeQGlhog","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/pVnh5qe-Xj0czHdeQGlhog.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8919133543968201},{"business_id":"OcatdPIYh9X2Du3Lo5YKOQ","photo_id":"S57J5yJYh0VrVhd5IOAHKw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/S57J5yJYh0VrVhd5IOAHKw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8568278551101685},{"business_id":"OcatdPIYh9X2Du3Lo5YKOQ","photo_id":"BAS2zaMQ7_-eO9h2T7Cxsw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/BAS2zaMQ7_-eO9h2T7Cxsw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8423580527305603},{"business_id":"OcatdPIYh9X2Du3Lo5YKOQ","photo_id":"i1Ff6RmJaRYUgU9w9QSMPQ","label":"food","